    {
      "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-1",
      "title": "Buttercup field guide",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-2",
          "kind": "markdown",
          "source": "\nButtercup is one of the *Powerpuff Girls*, alongside [Blossom](wiki:npcs/blossom) and [Bubbles](wiki:npcs/bubbles). The wiki groups NPC entries that share her name.\n\n> Check the build and NPC ID when following a location or mission tip.\n"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-3",
          "title": "Finding the right Buttercup",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-4",
              "kind": "markdown",
              "source": "\n1. Select the build you play.\n2. Open the Buttercup entry for the area or mission you’re looking for.\n"
            }
          ],
          "sections": [
            {
              "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-5",
              "title": "What to check on the NPC page",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-6",
                  "kind": "markdown",
                  "source": "\n- **Map** for where that version appears.\n- **Missions** for quests associated with that entry.\n"
                }
              ],
              "sections": [],
              "updatedAt": "2026-11-22T08:06:34.749Z"
            }
          ],
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-22T08:06:34.749Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-7",
          "title": "Example entries",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "00c81249-fc66-466a-a98b-3fce5e60e15f-8",
              "kind": "markdown",
              "source": "\n| Build | NPC ID | Role |\n| --- | ---: | --- |\n| Original | 720 | Quest |\n| Original and Retrobution | 773 | Quest |\n| Retrobution | 3328 | Defense |\n\nFor information about the server project, see [OpenFusion on GitHub](https://github.com/OpenFusionProject/OpenFusion).\n"
            }
          ],
